#: ../../howto/orders.rst:2 92e4ac91b7b946168b879f3fd14bfdbe
msgid "Manage orders and positions"
msgstr "管理订单与持仓"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:6 df73cb6102d84a64bf46ab8f0f559f64
msgid ""
"Every placement, modification, cancellation, TWAP, leverage, margin, or "
"close call is a real signed action on the selected network. Use testnet "
"first, inspect the encoded intent, enforce application-level limits, and "
"reconcile the result before retrying."
msgstr ""
"每次下单、修改、取消、TWAP、杠杆、保证金或平仓调用，都是所选网络上的真实签名操作。"
"请先使用 testnet，检查编码后的意图，实施应用级限制，并在重试前核对结果。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:12 442d632dbc644645a7703ceff613375b
msgid "Order requests"
msgstr "订单请求"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:14 3c25d96265ef4db3a4a4fce52f116006
msgid ""
"Root-client order workflows resolve metadata and encode prices and sizes."
" A ``PlaceOrderRequest`` uses one vocabulary for single and batch "
"operations:"
msgstr "根客户端订单工作流会解析元数据并编码价格和数量。``PlaceOrderRequest`` 对单笔和批量操作使用同一套字段："

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:34 c3e467fce514427cb6e4c63fe16d2007
msgid ""
"Submit with ``place_limit_order(request)`` or place a same-asset-class "
"tuple with ``place_orders(requests)``. A perpetual tuple may span the "
"base and HIP-3 DEXes; it cannot include spot or outcome markets. "
"``place_order(...)`` is an expanded convenience form. "
"``place_market_order()`` and ``is_market=True`` derive an aggressive "
"limit price from the current mid and ``slippage``; the Exchange still "
"decides whether the order fills. Slippage must be finite and in ``[0, "
"1)``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``place_limit_order(request)`` 提交，或使用 ``place_orders(requests)`` 下同一资产类别的订单元组。"
"perpetual 元组可跨基础和 HIP-3 DEX，但不能包含 spot 或 outcome 市场。``place_order(...)`` 是展开的便捷形式。"
"``place_market_order()`` 和 ``is_market=True`` 根据当前中间价与 ``slippage`` 推导激进的限价；"
"订单是否成交仍由 Exchange 决定。滑点必须为有限值且处于 ``[0, 1)``。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:41 d95f5d44f47141909e59abfc534d06af
msgid ""
"``TimeInForce.ALO`` rejects an order that would immediately cross, "
"``TimeInForce.IOC`` cancels any unfilled remainder, and "
"``TimeInForce.GTC`` may rest. A ``Cloid`` is a validated 16-byte client "
"order ID useful for idempotent application tracking. The SDK does not "
"guarantee server-side deduplication for arbitrary retries."
msgstr ""
"``TimeInForce.ALO`` 会拒绝立即穿透的订单，``TimeInForce.IOC`` 取消任何未成交余额，"
"而 ``TimeInForce.GTC`` 可以挂单。``Cloid`` 是经过验证的 16 字节客户端订单 ID，"
"可用于幂等的应用跟踪。SDK 不保证对任意重试进行服务端去重。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:48 afebeb6e405a48199bd17d2169ee7bdb
msgid "Triggers and TP/SL"
msgstr "触发器与 TP/SL"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:50 72e57731aecb4c2aa91005add687fac5
msgid ""
"Build trigger options with ``trigger_order_type()`` and submit a "
"``PlaceOrderRequest`` through ``place_trigger_order()`` or "
"``place_orders()``. The outer ``is_market`` must be false for a trigger; "
"``trigger.isMarket`` selects the child execution style."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``trigger_order_type()`` 构造触发选项，并通过 ``place_trigger_order()`` 或 "
"``place_orders()`` 提交 ``PlaceOrderRequest``。触发订单的外层 ``is_market`` 必须为 false；"
"``trigger.isMarket`` 选择子订单执行方式。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:55 2cca5aaf845a41ec8d9c3fbfc2f752e1
msgid ""
"For grouped TP/SL, pass ``OrderGrouping.NORMAL_TPSL`` with a non-trigger "
"parent first and one or more trigger children after it. Position TP/SL "
"uses ``OrderGrouping.POSITION_TPSL``. Set ``ro=True`` for reductions "
"where applicable. Do not use the outer market flag with a trigger order."
msgstr ""
"对于分组 TP/SL，请先传入带有非触发父订单的 ``OrderGrouping.NORMAL_TPSL``，"
"其后再传入一个或多个触发子订单。持仓 TP/SL 使用 ``OrderGrouping.POSITION_TPSL``。"
"在适用的减仓操作中设置 ``ro=True``。请勿将外层市价标志用于触发订单。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:61 7e347e82e56b4488a2515dd95ef109f5
msgid "TWAP"
msgstr "TWAP"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:63 bb17fd992a5248a9bcaa6a6080560289
msgid ""
"``place_twap()`` accepts coin, direction, size, duration in minutes, "
"optional randomization, and optional reduce-only behavior. It also "
"accepts optional ``trigger_px`` and ``stop_px`` advanced prices. Trigger "
"activation direction is inferred by comparing ``trigger_px`` with the "
"current mark price. TWAP prices are normalized using the resolved venue "
"precision. Cancel a running TWAP with ``cancel_twap(coin, twap_id)``."
msgstr ""
"``place_twap()`` 接受 coin、方向、数量、以分钟为单位的持续时间、可选随机化和可选仅减仓行为。"
"它还接受可选的 ``trigger_px`` 和 ``stop_px`` 高级价格。触发激活方向通过比较 ``trigger_px`` 与当前标记价格推断。"
"TWAP 价格会使用已解析的交易场所精度进行规范化。使用 ``cancel_twap(coin, twap_id)`` 取消运行中的 TWAP。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:71 21862d624d054cb3a5b2632859149cc5
msgid "Cancellation and modification"
msgstr "取消与修改"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:73 45db8c0b66a4469286ce8ced835e58cd
msgid ""
"Use ``CancelOrder(coin, oid)`` with ``cancel_order()`` or "
"``cancel_orders()``. Use ``CancelByCloid(coin, cloid)`` with "
"``cancel_by_cloid()`` or ``cancel_orders_by_cloid()``. Empty batches are "
"rejected locally."
msgstr ""
"将 ``CancelOrder(coin, oid)`` 与 ``cancel_order()`` 或 ``cancel_orders()`` 搭配使用。"
"将 ``CancelByCloid(coin, cloid)`` 与 ``cancel_by_cloid()`` 或 ``cancel_orders_by_cloid()`` 搭配使用。"
"空批次会在本地被拒绝。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:77 221a6dfb42e84b6b96c7288f05da5dce
msgid ""
"``ModifyOrderRequest`` identifies the order by integer order ID or "
"``Cloid`` and contains the complete replacement order. ``modify_order()``"
" returns a default acknowledgement; ``modify_orders()`` returns per-order"
" statuses."
msgstr ""
"``ModifyOrderRequest`` 通过整数订单 ID 或 ``Cloid`` 标识订单，并包含完整的替换订单。"
"``modify_order()`` 返回默认确认；``modify_orders()`` 返回每笔订单的状态。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:81 f456efd0e4cd418d939641669f3e1478
msgid ""
"``client.exchange.schedule_cancel(cancel_at)`` schedules dead-man "
"cancellation using an absolute millisecond timestamp; passing no "
"timestamp removes the schedule according to Exchange semantics."
msgstr ""
"``client.exchange.schedule_cancel(cancel_at)`` 使用绝对毫秒时间戳安排死手取消；"
"按 Exchange 语义，不传入时间戳会移除该计划。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:86 c0488ccf8ffb428c8de96eb07716107b
msgid "Closing and risk settings"
msgstr "平仓与风险设置"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:88 dd949ac5d4b747b18e01ea7450a5a0fd
msgid ""
"``close_position()`` and ``close_positions()`` read each full current "
"position and submit reduce-only market orders. Despite its name, "
"``close_all_positions(dexs=None)`` does not discover every HIP-3 DEX. It "
"uses the ``dexs`` configured on ``AsyncHyperliquid``; the constructor "
"default is ``(\"\",)``, which scans only the base perpetual DEX. Include "
"every intended HIP-3 DEX explicitly in the constructor or in the "
"``close_all_positions(dexs=)`` call. Re-query final positions through a "
"trusted Info endpoint. These methods are not partial-close helpers; use "
"an explicit reduce-only order for a partial reduction."
msgstr ""
"``close_position()`` 和 ``close_positions()`` 会读取每笔完整的当前持仓，并提交仅减仓市价订单。"
"尽管名称如此，``close_all_positions(dexs=None)`` 不会发现全部 HIP-3 DEX。"
"它使用 ``AsyncHyperliquid`` 上配置的 ``dexs``；构造函数默认值是 ``(\"\",)``，只扫描基础 perpetual DEX。"
"请在构造函数中或 ``close_all_positions(dexs=)`` 调用中显式包含每个目标 HIP-3 DEX。"
"通过可信的 Info 端点重新查询最终持仓。这些方法不是部分平仓辅助方法；部分减仓请使用明确的仅减仓订单。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:98 9f679b4d19614294a3ae9fac9ba4eccd
msgid ""
"``update_leverage()`` and ``update_isolated_margin()`` resolve the coin's"
" asset ID before signing. Treat both as risk-changing operations and "
"verify resulting account state independently."
msgstr ""
"``update_leverage()`` 和 ``update_isolated_margin()`` 会在签名前解析 coin 的 asset ID。"
"请将两者都视为改变风险的操作，并独立验证得到的账户状态。"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:103 10424e5c230a4c098b366a4ecec20c42
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "响应"

#: ../../howto/orders.rst:105 1ba5621776b347089b83da29aa19db4f
msgid ""
"Transport success does not imply action success. Inspect the top-level "
"``response[\"status\"]``. Only when it is ``\"ok\"`` should an "
"application inspect each item in "
"``response[\"response\"][\"data\"][\"statuses\"]`` for resting, filled, "
"waiting, or error status. When the top-level status is ``\"err\"``, "
"``response[\"response\"]`` is the rejection string instead of the success"
" envelope. See :doc:`../reference/response-types` and :doc:`lifecycle-"
"reconciliation`."
msgstr ""
"传输成功并不表示操作成功。请检查顶层 ``response[\"status\"]``。仅当其为 ``\"ok\"`` 时，"
"应用才应检查 ``response[\"response\"][\"data\"][\"statuses\"]`` 中的每项是否为挂单、已成交、"
"等待或错误状态。当顶层状态为 ``\"err\"`` 时，``response[\"response\"]`` 是拒绝字符串而非成功封装。"
"参见 :doc:`../reference/response-types` 和 :doc:`lifecycle-reconciliation`。"
